{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive hordes of monsters and bosses</strong> while collecting cards that add unique ability upgrades to the body of a small snake, <strong>Mechaconda</strong>. A reimagining of the classic Snake game with modern gameplay and intense bullet hell action. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat all bosses created by Dr. EVIL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/fc64befc415ca15e9c812479085275ef.poster.avif?t=1762548904\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/fc64befc415ca15e9c812479085275ef.webm?t=1762548904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/fc64befc415ca15e9c812479085275ef.mp4?t=1762548904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/4ff6a34c519c68ac02794fb11df2ccdc.poster.avif?t=1762548904\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/4ff6a34c519c68ac02794fb11df2ccdc.webm?t=1762548904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/4ff6a34c519c68ac02794fb11df2ccdc.mp4?t=1762548904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL THE LEVEL HORDES\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, become stronger, and destroy all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.s